      en: ["The port is situated in Miragoâne Bay, one of the deepest natural harbors in Haiti.", "Miragoâne is the capital of the Nippes department, which was established in 2003.", "The region was historically significant for bauxite exports until the 1980s.", "The port serves as an important secondary facility to relieve Port-au-Prince's main port.", "The town of Miragoâne was originally founded by the French in the 17th century.", "Regular ferry services connect the port with other coastal towns in the region."],
